 Certain cards, like the Gallery card, will automatically populate with shared items so that you don't have to search for them when choosing what you want to display on your site.<br /><br />Contact support with any questions related to this group or content management for your site.<br /><br /><strong>DO NOT DELETE THIS GROUP.<\/strong>","snippet":"Applications, maps, data, etc. shared with this group generates the UAE-Abu Dhabi 1 content catalog.","tags":["Hub Group","Hub Content Group","Hub Site Group"],"typeKeywords":[],"phone":null,"sortField":"modified","sortOrder":"desc","isViewOnly":false,"featuredItemsId":null,"thumbnail":null,"created":1744207719000,"modified":1744207720000,"access":"public","capabilities":[],"isFav":false,"isReadOnly":false,"protected":true,"autoJoin":false,"notificationsEnabled":false,"provider":null,"providerGroupName":null,"leavingDisallowed":false,"hiddenMembers":false,"displaySettings":{"itemTypes":""},"properties":null},{"id":"03b45995a09a45feb751614de9a5edb3","title":"UAE-Abu Dhabi 1 Content 1","isInvitationOnly":false,"owner":"EsriNeA.ISD","description":"Use this group to organize the items that you want to share as part of your site. Shared items become available in your site's search results and only people who have access to these items will be able to find them. Members of the core team get access to shared items and can update them at any time. Certain cards, like the Gallery card, will automatically populate with shared items so that you don't have to search for them when choosing what you want to display on your site.<br /><br />Contact support with any questions related to this group or content management for your site.<br /><br /><strong>DO NOT DELETE THIS GROUP.<\/strong>","snippet":"Applications, maps, data, etc. shared with this group generates the UAE-Abu Dhabi 1 content catalog.","tags":["Hub Group","Hub Content Group","Hub Site Group"],"typeKeywords":[],"phone":null,"sortField":"modified","sortOrder":"desc","isViewOnly":false,"featuredItemsId":null,"thumbnail":null,"created":1744207739000,"modified":1744207739000,"access":"public","capabilities":[],"isFav":false,"isReadOnly":false,"protected":true,"autoJoin":false,"notificationsEnabled":false,"provider":null,"providerGroupName":null,"leavingDisallowed":false,"hiddenMembers":false,"displaySettings":{"itemTypes":""},"properties":null},{"id":"f76aac87aa4c4e6393a25bdfce79c3a4","title":"SCAD","isInvitationOnly":false,"owner":"maalmerri","description":"\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Statistics Centre - Abu Dhabi (SCAD) was established in fulfillment of \r\nthe wise vision of UAE President, HH Sheikh Khalifa bin Zayed Al Nahyan(may \r\nAllah protect him) and HH Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Al Nahyan, Crown Prince of \r\nAbu Dhabi and Deputy Supreme Commander of the Armed Forces, reflecting their \r\nHighnesses keen resolve to accelerate the pace of development and advance the \r\nnational economy.<\/span><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>SCAD was established in accordance with Law No. (7) for the year 2008, \r\nwith a view to develop and organize statistical work in the Emirate of Abu Dhabi \r\nin particular and the United Arab Emirates in general. The Centre therefore has \r\nan independent legal personality and financial autonomy, and full legal capacity \r\nto act in a manner that is consistent with the emirate\u2019s orientation towards \r\nsustainable development and strategic plans under the supervision and with full \r\nsupport of the Executive Council of the Emirate of Abu Dhabi.<\/span><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>In the performance of its mission and strategic plan, the Centre aspires \r\nto evolve into a distinguished institution that manages to cope with the \r\nrequirements of the upcoming stage, which will see a focus achieving high rates \r\nof growth and sustainable development. SCAD looks forward to becoming an active \r\npartner and contributor at all levels.<\/span><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Being the main official body <font color='#636466'>concerned<\/font> with \r\nthe collection of statistical data in the Emirate of Abu Dhabi, the Centre \r\nassumes the functions of preparing the statistical plans programs that serve the \r\nemirate\u2019s development programs, conducting statistical surveys all over the \r\nemirate, without prejudice to the interest of national statistical work. SCAD is \r\nalso responsible for the collection, classification, storage, analysis and \r\ndissemination of official statistics and the release of the results of social, \r\ndemographic, economic, environmental and cultural, surveys.<\/span><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>The activities of the Centre will encompass all areas relating to social \r\nconditions in accordance with relevant international standards and ethics, such \r\nas independence, professionalism, impartiality, objectivity, confidentiality, \r\ncost effectiveness and quality of statistics.<\/span><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>As a local Government entity, SCAD is also committed to fully cooperate \r\nwith the local and Federal government entities in conducting statistical surveys \r\nas per the annual schedule of surveys endorsed by the federal body concerned, \r\nand in accordance with its adopted methodologies, standards, classifications, \r\ndefinitions, questionnaires and forms, and planned survey dates. However, this \r\nis granted without prejudice to the right of SCAD to conduct statistical surveys \r\nwithin the emirate of Abu Dhabi according to its annual plan, and provided that \r\nthe described cooperation does not run counter to the interest of national \r\nstatistical work, with care being taken to ensure compliance with the policies \r\nof dissemination of statistical data pursued by Federal authorities in the \r\nrelease of national indicators. The Centre will also contribute towards any \r\ne-link projects with Federal bodies for the purpose of conducting joint surveys \r\nwhenever necessary. <\/span><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>SCAD\u2019s mandate assigns it as the main authority concerned with the \r\ncollection of statistical data, using standard methods and advanced techniques. \r\nThe data is then duly examined and analyzed for extraction of indicators that \r\nserve the goals of development. These functions make the Centre a key source of \r\ninformation to decision and policy makers, blazing the track for development and \r\ngrowth, and serving in addition the needs of the public, the business community, \r\nresearchers, the media, etc.<\/span><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Finally, it is important to point out the need to promote awareness \r\nabout the importance of statistical data and its role in enhancing sustainable \r\ndevelopment by fostering ties of fruitful cooperation between the Centre and the \r\nentire range of stakeholders across the community.<\/span><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><b><span style='color: red; font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Vision<\/span><\/b><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>To be a recognized statistics centre, contributing to the development \r\neffort of Abu Dhabi.<\/span><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><b><span style='color: rgb(238, 49, 36); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Mission<\/span><\/b><span style='font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'><font color='#636466'>The centre aims to:<\/font><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'><font color='#636466'>Develop and organize a statistical system in the \r\nEmirate.<\/font><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'><\/span><font color='#636466'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;courier new&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'><span><span style='font: 7pt/normal &quot;times new roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;'> <\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Provide relevant and reliable official statistics serving policy makers, \r\nthe business community and the public.<\/span><\/font><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;'><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><b><span style='color: red; font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Values<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><b><span style='color: red; font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'><\/span><\/b><b><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Independence<\/span><\/b><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>: Maintain independence in the selection of methodologies, definitions \r\nand data sources, and in the timing of releases.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'><\/span><b><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Transparency<\/span><\/b><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>: Apply transparent and widely accepted procedures, communicating \r\nmethodologies and adopting unbiased approach.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'><\/span><b><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Reliability<\/span><\/b><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>: Strive for accuracy and consistency in collecting, processing, storing \r\nand disseminating official statistics.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'><\/span><b><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>User focus<\/span><\/b><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>: Meet the needs of users with relevant data, enable easy access to \r\ninformation, and release official statistics in a timely way.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p style='text-align: justify; line-height: normal;'><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'><\/span><b><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>Confidentiality<\/span><\/b><span style='color: rgb(99, 100, 102); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;'>: Guarantee privacy of individual Information.<\/span><\/p>","snippet":"Statistics Centre - Abu Dhabi (SCAD) ","tags":["Abu Dhabi Statistics","SCAD"],"typeKeywords":[],"phone":"","sortField":null,"sortOrder":null,"isViewOnly":false,"featuredItemsId":null,"thumbnail":"ScadLogo.png","created":1331032358000,"modified":1331032497000,"access":"public","capabilities":[],"isFav":false,"isReadOnly":false,"protected":false,"autoJoin":false,"notificationsEnabled":false,"provider":null,"providerGroupName":null,"leavingDisallowed":false,"hiddenMembers":false,"displaySettings":{"itemTypes":""},"orgId":"none","properties":null},{"id":"f798690db7b14b93b72fdf4eeba9d236","title":"Rhythms of Abu Dhabi","isInvitationOnly":true,"owner":"su22_yn852","description":null,"snippet":null,"tags":[],"typeKeywords":[],"phone":null,"sortField":"title","sortOrder":"asc","isViewOnly":false,"featuredItemsId":null,"thumbnail":null,"created":1662469391000,"modified":1662469391000,"access":"public","capabilities":[],"isFav":false,"isReadOnly":false,"protected":false,"autoJoin":false,"notificationsEnabled":false,"provider":null,"providerGroupName":null,"leavingDisallowed":false,"hiddenMembers":false,"membershipAccess":"org","displaySettings":{"itemTypes":""},"properties":null},{"id":"25917df330224946b1c28f6e5c14f553","title":"gfijuytre","isInvitationOnly":true,"owner":"fvdytrewq","description":"<figure><table style='border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt;' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tbody><tr style='height:21px;'><td style='border-right:1px solid transparent; color:#1155cc; overflow:visible; padding:2px 0px;'><div style='overflow:hidden; width:701px;'><div style='float:left;'><a target='_blank' href='https://500px.com/p/callgirls-indubai/galleries/dubai-call-girls-971567343249-exclusive-call-girls-in-dubai' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><u>https://500px.com/p/callgirls-indubai/galleries/dubai-call-girls-971567343249-exclusive-call-girls-in-dubai<\/u><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr style='height:21px;'><td style='border-